|---------|------------|
| Apple Health / steps | Disabled — stub data |
| Google Sign-In | Disabled — use "Continue as guest" |
| Push notifications | Skipped |
| Live2D models (Asuka + Alexia) | Bundled on phone (~37MB total) |
| Chat / brain / sync | AWS `http://13.51.141.42:3000` |

